// Lists made in conversation (memory-spec Part 6.1 and 7): "make a shopping list" mints one
// (ShoppingList_1, IsA(List(Shopping()))), each thing added is a ListItem on it, taking one off
// retracts it, and what is on it is what still holds. Which list is meant is worked out from what
// the words say of it ("shopping"), then what is newest. Written by scripts/pack.mjs from
// sources/lists (edit those, not this).
Requires(Core(), Basic(), Memory())

// A thing on a list.
Concept(ListItem(), IsA(Relation()))

// A list started, and things put on or taken off one: said by packs/english.ncon.
Concept(ListMade(), IsA(Result()))

Concept(ListAdded(), IsA(Result()))

Concept(ListRemoved(), IsA(Result()))

Concept(ListHolds(), IsA(Result()))
